The '''Windwailer''' was an ancient rock formation on the [[planet]] [[Ahch-To]].<ref name="TROS VD" /> The violent storms and rainfalls of this world had shaped the rock and given it a very peculiar shape, vaguely reminiscent of the paw of a gigantic animal pointing up to the sky.<ref name="Exegol">{{EncyclopediaCite|Exegol, the Unknown Regions and Wild Space}}</ref> While training with a [[lightsaber]], [[Rey Skywalker|Rey]] accidentally split the Windwailer in two with overly energetic practice of ''[[cadence]]s''.<ref name="TROS VD" />

